\",\"The cloud company’s new AI tool analyzes training experiments, visualizes data, and automates insights as cloud providers expand beyond infrastructure.\",\"Next-Gen Data Centers\",\"/next-gen-data-centers\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":417},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/bltfc774b46a7725220/6a428118d53b56bd1cbecd05/GettyImages-2207352561.jpg\",\"coreweave logo on a tall building\",{\"_164\":434,\"_166\":435},[433],\"AWS Launches Graviton5-Powered EC2 Instances for AI and HPC\",\"/data-center-chips/aws-makes-the-case-for-cpus-in-the-ai-stack\",{},\"Jun 30, 2026\",\"New Graviton5-powered C9g and C9gd instances target AI orchestration alongside HPC and analytics, as AWS argues CPUs remain central to the next generation of AI infrastructure.\",\"Data Center Chips\",\"/infrastructure/data-center-hardware/data-center-chips\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":432},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt22fbda6aebfd77b6/6a43d25a55d1b572e7a00c54/1213311671976503-0-G5_Angled.jpg\",\"AWS chip\",{\"_164\":446,\"_166\":447},[445],\"Why AI Data Centers Make Existing Power Plants More Valuable\",\"/energy-power-supply/why-ai-data-centers-make-existing-power-plants-more-valuable\",{},\"As AI accelerates electricity demand, utilities and investors are paying a growing premium for existing generation that can reach the grid faster than new projects.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":444},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt056ed40adf18618e/6a43dfc8d6cfe57cfab99a32/GettyImages-1868190563.jpg\",\"power substation\",{\"_164\":459,\"_166\":460},[458],\"Brookfield-Bloom $25B Aims to Make Energy Certainty Financeable\",\"/energy-power-supply/brookfield-bloom-s-25-billion-gambit-signals-ai-power-s-emergence-as-an-asset-class\",{},\"Jul 1, 2026\",\"The expansion reflects a strategic shift where capital providers bundle financing with guaranteed power delivery from day one, enabling hyperscalers to advance projects on schedule even while awaiting utility connections.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":457},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt0b39d9d4d4e57c0d/6a44fad7c1d2df16e950ad9a/bloom-energy-install-utility.jpg\",\"an installation of bloom energy units\",{\"_164\":471,\"_166\":472},[470],\"AI Interconnect Delays Spur $1.75B National Grid-Joulent Deal\",\"/energy-power-supply/national-grid-agrees-to-1-75b-investment-in-joulent-to-expand-ai-power-infrastructure\",{},\"The utility’s planned $1.75 billion investment in Joulent illustrates how dedicated power infrastructure is becoming central to AI data center growth.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":469},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/bltf296102f7d0c8812/6a4533bf8b73521d38a1d31d/GettyImages-2198004413.jpg\",\"national grid logo on a sign\",{\"_164\":484,\"_166\":485},[483],\"Texas Tests New Rules for AI Campuses Behind Existing Power Plants\",\"/energy-power-supply/texas-tests-new-rules-for-ai-campuses-behind-existing-power-plants\",{},\"Jul 2, 2026\",\"PUCT staff backs ERCOT’s proposed operating conditions in an early test of Texas’ new framework for colocated data centers.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":482},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt0936e6555ce7084c/6a457ff3cef8a857aff97ffe/Power_collection_grid_substation_and_wind_turbine.png\",\"Power collection grid substation and wind turbine\",{\"_164\":497,\"_166\":498},[496],\"NERC Flags AI Data Center Grid Risks in Report\",\"/energy-power-supply/nerc-flags-ai-data-center-grid-risks-in-report\",{},\"Jul 3, 2026\",\"NERC’s 2026 report emphasizes that as individual campuses approach gigawatt scale and cluster regionally, these abrupt disconnections now threaten grid stability and require new modeling standards, operational coordination, and regulatory frameworks.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":495},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt8038406ca805d0b7/6a45140b2197494acba9c501/gdc-east-monckscorner-mnk-exterior-drone-2025-0081.webp\",\"Google’s data center campus in Moncks Corner, South Carolina\",{\"_164\":512,\"_166\":513},[511],\"IBM Brings Z to 19-Inch Racks as AI Reshapes Data Centers\",\"/servers/ibm-brings-z17-mainframes-to-standard-racks\",{},\"Jul 7, 2026\",\"New rack-mount and single-frame systems give enterprises more flexibility as data center space, cooling, and AI demands intensify.\",\"Servers\",\"/infrastructure/data-center-hardware/servers\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":510},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt1cc2ebaae7ff9c9f/6a4be78ae4825010b0dd8df6/z17_Single_Frame_Lifestyle.jpg\",\"IBM infrastructure in an enterprise data center\",{\"_164\":525,\"_166\":526},[524],\"Second Major Virginia Data Center Project Dies, Raising AI Site Selection Stakes\",\"/data-center-site-selection/second-major-virginia-data-center-project-dies-raising-ai-site-selection-stakes\",{},\"Jul 8, 2026\",\"Days after QTS abandoned its $30 billion Digital Gateway project, county supervisors unanimously rejected the first planning step for a proposed 43 million-square-foot data center campus.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":523},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt6f679