-constrained infrastructure, delaying software deals and driving shares down 23%.\",\"Business\",\"/business\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":606},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt32eefa38c377e2cb/6a564adc8b033b1f39724f38/GettyImages-85480320.jpg\",\"IBM headquarters image\",{\"_164\":620,\"_166\":621},[619],\"New York Data Center Moratorium: State Pauses Projects Over 50 MW\",\"/data-center-construction/new-york-data-center-moratorium-state-pauses-projects-over-50-mw\",{},\"A new executive order pauses certain permits for new data centers above 50 MW as New York develops rules for grid costs, water use, and host communities.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":618},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt294898a7d2ca9d08/6a56748b107b9080a9b97fda/New-York-Data-Center.jpg\",\"New York data center illustration\",{\"_164\":635,\"_166\":636},[634],\"TSMC Expands Arizona Campus to $265B as AI Demand Surges\",\"/infrastructure/tsmc-expands-arizona-campus-to-265b-as-ai-demand-surges\",{},\"Jul 16, 2026\",\"The chipmaker raises capital spending outlook after cloud providers continue signaling robust demand for AI infrastructure.\",\"Infrastructure\",\"/infrastructure\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":633},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blta61748946ed985be/6a58bec1ecc3002a500a2dbe/886f3f60-8e23-493d-85ff-2f76d1ac18bc.jpg\",\"aerial view of TSMC facilities\",{\"_164\":648,\"_166\":649},[647],\"Palm Beach Denial Challenges Wall Street's AI Power Bet\",\"/data-center-construction/project-tango-denial-challenges-wall-street-s-ai-power-bet\",{},\"Jul 17, 2026\",\"Jefferies says Palm Beach County's rejection of a proposed 600 MW AI campus shows local permitting could d