ulations/lawsuit-tests-water-strategy-behind-california-s-lithium-valley\",{},\"Jul 22, 2026\",\"The case serves as a critical early test for Imperial County’s Lithium Valley development strategy, which envisions shifting agricultural water to support decades of industrial growth, including lithium processing and data centers.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":693},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/bltcab4b01bedc3a647/6a60c665a09f987322f9067d/6bb284_f77512fe9f3e40a4bccae73ef2c79ab2~mv2.jpg\",\"rendering of IVCM proposed data center campus\",{\"_164\":707,\"_166\":52},[706],\"White House Warns PJM to Reform Grid Governance ‘Before It Is Too Late’\",\"/energy-power-supply/after-blockbuster-breakup-report-white-house-warns-pjm-to-reform\",{},\"Amid mounting pressure over rising AI power demand, the White House warns PJM Interconnection to overhaul its industry-controlled board or face potential regulatory fallout.\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":705},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/bltbe0075bc1ec0614f/6a6114143fa22d1bec211e7b/Energy_US-Getty.jpg\",{\"_164\":720,\"_166\":721},[719],\"Fault in Data Center Alley Triggered 3 GW Load Drop\",\"/outages/fault-in-data-center-alley-triggered-3-gw-load-drop-on-pjm\",{},\"Dominion says data centers transferred to backup power after a transmission line fault, creating one of the largest sudden load changes publicly reported on the US grid.\",\"Outages\",\"/security-and-risk-management/outages\",{\"_154\":25,\"_155\":718},{\"_152\":25,\"_153\":25},[],{\"_43\":158,\"_115\":159,\"_160\":161,\"_162\":163},\"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8eb3cdfc1fce5194/blt4a03c4767458dd4d/6a622d559fc250c80921971e/GettyImages-2161851139_(1).jpg\",\"Amazon Web Services’ IAD71  data center\",{\"_164\":737,\"_166\":738},[732],